{"id":71287,"date":"2026-10-29T18:53:50","date_gmt":"2026-10-29T18:53:50","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=71287"},"modified":"2026-10-29T19:54:53","modified_gmt":"2026-10-29T18:54:53","slug":"meia-maratona-de-roma","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-de-roma\/","title":{"rendered":"Wizz Air Meia Maratona de Roma 2027"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Wizz Air Meia Maratona de Roma 2027<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Wizz Air Meia Maratona de Roma 2027<\/strong> (4\u00aa edi\u00e7\u00e3o) realiza-se no domingo, <strong>17 de outubro de 2027<\/strong>, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o monumental de <strong>Roma<\/strong>, em <strong>It\u00e1lia<\/strong>. Organizada pela <strong>RomaOstia SSD<\/strong> em parceria com a <strong>RCS Sports &amp; Events<\/strong>, sob a \u00e9gide da FIDAL e da World Athletics, esta meia maratona afirmou-se rapidamente como a mais participada de It\u00e1lia, reunindo mais de 22.000 corredores internacionais num cen\u00e1rio hist\u00f3rico \u00fanico.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O evento compreende a dist\u00e2ncia principal da <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> e a corrida paralela <strong>Longevity Run (5 km)<\/strong>, percorrendo as avenidas e pra\u00e7as mais emblem\u00e1ticas da Cidade Eterna \u2014 do Circo Massimo e Termas de Caracala ao Coliseu, Piazza Navona e margens do rio Tibre \u2014 num tra\u00e7ado de asfalto fluido e vocacionado para excelentes marcas pessoais no outono europeu. Explora tamb\u00e9m o calend\u00e1rio das melhores <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/meia-maratona\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Meias Maratonas em Portugal<\/a> e prepara a tua prova na <a href=\"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/calculadora\/\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; text-decoration: underline;\">Calculadora de Ritmo (Pace)<\/a>.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"